  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Negotiated Partnerships: ADRA - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Negotiated Partnership&#xa0;with the Adventist Development and Relief Agency (ADRA)&#xa0;New Zealand to support 50 remote communities across Fiji, Vanuatu, Timor-Leste, Cambodia to improve climate, disaster, social and economic resilience. This will be achieved through targeted interventions in Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene (WASH) and&#xa0;agriculture interventions, and community planning to identify and mitigate climate (and other hazards) risks.</narrative>
  </description>
